  "raw_label": "appellant_lost",
  "texts": {
    "preamble": "S L Srinivasa vs The Additional on 9 September, 2024 -1- Nc: 2024:Khc:36568 Wp No. 42108 of 2015 In The High Court Of Karnataka At Bengaluru Dated This The 9Th Day Of September, 2024 Before THE HON'BLE MR. JUSTICE K. V. ARAVIND WRIT PETITION NO. 42108 OF 2015 (GM-RES) BETWEEN: 1. S. L. SRINIVASA S/O. LATE LAKSHMAIAH AGED ABOUT 35 YEARS INDEPENDENT DISTRIBUTOR SUKHILIFE NUTRITION CENTRE SOMESHWARA NAGAR KADUR CHICKMAGALUR ...PETITIONER (BY SRI MANJU SUBBAIAH M., ADVOCATE) AND: 1. THE ADDITIONAL DISTRICT MAGISTRATE CUM ADJUDICATING OFFICER OFFICE OF THE DEPUTY COMMISSIONER Digitally signed by CHICKMAGALUR - 577 001. VALLI MARIMUTHU Location: 2. TEH FOOD SAFETY OFFICER High Court of Karnataka TALUK HEALTH OFFICE KADUR CHICKMAGALUR DISTRICT - 577 548. 3. THE STATE OF KARNATAKA REP. BY ITS PRINCIPAL SECRETARY VIDHANA SOUDHA DR. AMBEDKAR VEEDHI BANGALORE - 560 001. ...RESPONDENTS (BY SRI S.H. RAGHAVENDRA., AGA) -2- S L Srinivasa vs The Additional on 9 September, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/4693969/ 1 NC: 2024:KHC:36568 WP No. 42108 of 2015 THIS WRIT PETITION IS FILED UNDER ARTICLE 226 OF THE CONSTITUTION OF INDIA PRAYING TO CALL FOR RECORDS FROM THE ADDITIONAL DISTRICT MAGISTRATE AND ADJUDICATING OFFICER, CHICKMAGALUR AND TO QUASH THE ORDER DTD:10.08.2015 COPY PRODUCED AND MARKED AS ANNEXURE-L AND ETC, . THIS PETITION, COMING ON FOR PRELIMINARY HEARING IN 'B' GROUP, THIS DAY, ORDER WAS MADE THEREIN AS UNDER: CORAM: HON'BLE MR JUSTICE K V ARAVIND ORAL ORDER This Court by order dated 05.09.2024 has observed as under; \"The petitioner has challenged the order under Section 68 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 wherein, penalty of Rs.5 lacks has been levied. After the interim order, matter was listed on 02.12.2022, 01.02.2023, 14.02.2023, 27.05.2024 and 30.05.2024.",
    "facts": "Except on one date, there was no representation on behalf of the petitioner.",
    "arguments": ""
  },
